                <span class="qg-card__value" style="font-size:1rem;" data-i18n="card.services.title">🛎️ Services</span>
                <span class="qg-card__label" data-i18n="card.services.label">Livraison, garde, plus →</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/client-qg/plans" class="qg-card qg-card--tilt" style="text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;">
