                <span class="qg-card__value" style="font-size:1rem;" data-i18n="card.plans.title">🎁 Meilleurs Plans</span>
                <span class="qg-card__label" data-i18n="card.plans.label">Découvrir la surprise →</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/client-qg/academie" class="qg-card qg-card--tilt" style="text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;">
